<title>USA: Virco raises annual dividend to $0.10/shr.</title>
<headline>Virco raises annual dividend to $0.10/shr.</headline>
<dateline>LOS ANGELES 1996-10-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Virco Manufacturing Corp said it increased its annual dividend to $0.10 per share from $0.04.</p>
<p>It said the increase was made because of improved cash flow.</p>
</text>
